{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"收起详情"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["许可证本身不收费。但场地和设施要达标，现场核查加上办证要几个星期。卖肉的还要每批留好检疫证明和肉品品质检验合格证。"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["食品安全法：做食品生意要先拿许可。自己生产食品、卖食品、做餐饮，都要依法拿到许可。「但是，销售食用农产品和仅销售预包装食品的，不需要取得许可。仅销售预包装食品的，应当报所在地县级以上地方人民政府食品安全监督管理部门备案」。食用农产品就是生鲜肉、蔬菜这类没加工过的。预包装食品就是别人做好、连包装一起卖的。「食品生产加工小作坊和食品摊贩等的具体管理办法由省、自治区、直辖市制定」，这两类由各省自己出规矩。没拿到许可就做食品生意的，挣到的钱、食品以及工具设备原料全部没收。这批货按售价算的总金额（货值金额）不足一万元的，另罚 5 万元以上 10 万元以下。货值金额一万元以上的，按货值的 10 倍以上 20 倍以下罚。生猪屠宰管理条例：猪只能在国家指定的屠宰厂宰，由官方集中检疫。「除农村地区个人自宰自食的不实行定点屠宰外，任何单位和个人未经定点不得从事生猪屠宰活动」。「从事生猪产品销售、肉食品生产加工的单位和个人以及餐饮服务经营者、集中用餐单位生产经营的生猪产品，必须是生猪定点屠宰厂（场）经检疫和肉品品质检验合格的生猪产品」。所以你卖的、用的猪肉都得来自指定屠宰厂，检疫和肉品品质检验这两道都得过。没在指定屠宰厂私自宰猪的，勒令关停，猪、屠宰的工具设备和挣到的钱一起没收，罚多少和上面没证做食品那一档一样。动物防疫法：卖的和运的动物产品，要随货带着检疫证明和检疫标志。没带的勒令改正，再按同类合格货的货值金额罚一倍以下。司法解释：小作坊和食品摊贩做的、卖的食品不符合食品安全标准的，买家要求按十倍赔（惩罚性赔偿，就是退钱之外再多赔的那笔），法院应当支持（全国）"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原始出处"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["全国人大常委会 (2025 年第三次修正). 食品安全法（第三十五、三十六、一百二十二条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=7b5a76d0461745a08d3f964916b87ef3","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=7b5a76d0461745a08d3f964916b87ef3"]},"；国务院 (2021). 生猪屠宰管理条例（国务院令第 742 号，第二、二十三、三十一条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2021-07/22/content_5626534.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/2021-07/22/content_5626534.htm"]},"；全国人大常委会 (2021 修订). 动物防疫法（第五十一、一百条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff8080817703add2017737395a973e31","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=ff8080817703add2017737395a973e31"]},"；最高人民法院 (2024). 关于审理食品药品惩罚性赔偿纠纷案件适用法律若干问题的解释（法释〔2024〕9 号，第四条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"http://gongbao.court.gov.cn/Details/bf531a70471f10d377788f28d3d8f8.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["http://gongbao.court.gov.cn/Details/bf531a70471f10d377788f28d3d8f8.html"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://flk.npc.gov.cn/detail?id=7b5a76d0461745a08d3f964916b87ef3","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["打开来源链接"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["小作坊、小餐饮、食品摊贩的门槛是各省定的，本条不写具体数字。去你所在省的市场监管局官网，搜「食品小作坊小餐饮小摊贩管理条例」，看当地的版本。在网上卖自制食品，不会因为「在网上」就少一张证，该许可的照样要许可。许可之外还有这一节的通用规则：主体和执照见第 6 条（注册前把名称、场所、经营范围定下来），别的行当要不要证见第 7 条（要许可证的行当）。买家能要多少赔偿见第 5 节第 31 条（食品的十倍赔偿）。"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/12-07"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"要许可证的行当，证没下来不开张"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/12-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"装袋卖就是预包装食品：标签上生产日期、保质期、配料表一样都不能少"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/12-04"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["不当挂名股东，不替人代持股权"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["名字登记在册，你在法律上就是股东。注册时答应出的钱要按期交齐，交不上除了补交还要赔公司的损失。公司开办时别的股东没真把钱交进来，缺多少你也…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/12-05"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["加盟前先查商务部备案，拿到书面披露，把「冷静期」写进合同"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["按规定，品牌方自己得先开 2 个直营店、经营满 1 年，签约后 15 日内还要去商务部门备案。签约前，它必须把加盟费、保证金怎么退、现有门…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/12-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["注册前把名称、经营场所、经营范围和注册资本定下来，材料齐了当场就能领执照"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["登记本身不花钱，注册费 2015 年起就停征了。要交的材料只有五项：申请书、身份或资格证明、经营场所文件、章程或合伙协议（个体户不用交），…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/12-10"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["普通食品不许说能治病：标签、说明书、广告和直播话术都算"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["普通食品的标签、说明书和广告里，都不能说自己能防病治病。除了医疗、药品、医疗器械这三类广告，别的广告都不许说能治病，也不许用听着像药的词。…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/12-11"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["食品这一行有刑事线：卖病死肉、超标货就够罪，掺了有毒有害的不看金额、起刑五年"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["前面几条罚的是钱，这条抓的是人。卖病死肉、检验不合格的肉，或者农残兽残重金属严重超标的东西，只要「足以」让人吃出严重中毒就够罪，不用真有人…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/12-12"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["领了执照就开始有申报义务，没有收入也要按期零申报（照报一张全是零的表）"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["领了执照就要按期报税。一分钱没赚也要报，只是表上数字全填零。不报先罚 2000 元以下，情节严重的罚 2000 到 1 万。连着三个月所有…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/12"},"children":["阅读整个主题：创业与做生意：别把家底赔进去"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"tru